@startuml
title Part 1 - Batch Related WorkItems (Sequence)

actor User
participant "Trace UI" as UI
participant "WorkItemController" as WIC
participant "WorkItemService" as WIS
participant "Azure DevOps APIs" as ADO

User -> UI: Select user stories/work item IDs
User -> UI: Click Batch Related Analysis
UI -> WIC: GET /workitem/related?workItemIds=...
WIC -> WIS: getRelatedWorkItemsBatch(ids, project)
WIS -> ADO: Fetch work items and linked relations
ADO --> WIS: Related hierarchy and links
WIS --> WIC: RelatedWorkItemsBatchResponseDTO
WIC --> UI: Consolidated related result
UI --> User: Show batch related graph and counters

@enduml
